{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "And therefore, to you, I turn to me as citizen of Locris, who are at once a philosopher and a statesman, and to you, Cretius, whom all Athenians know to be similarly accomplished, and to Hermocrates, who is also fitted by nature and education to share in our discourse.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["And", " therefore", ",", " to", " you", ",", " I", " turn", " to", " me", " as", " citizen", " of", " Loc", "ris", ",", " who", " are", " at", " once", " a", " philosopher", " and", " a", " states", "man", ",", " and", " to", " you", ",", " C", "ret", "ius", ",", " whom", " all", " Athen", "ians", " know", " to", " be", " similarly", " accomplished", ",", " and", " to", " Herm", "ocrates", ",", " who", " is", " also", " fitted", " by", " nature", " and", " education", " to", " share", " in", " our", " discourse", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
